                    "In Client Visual, the event and tag_read result are structured product objects. Access fields with dots: `event.visualObjectId`, `sample.quality` and `sample.value`. The result is not an ordinary Python dictionary; `sample[\"quality\"]` causes a type error in this Runtime. A dictionary you create yourself still uses brackets. Do not transfer this rule to ServerRuntimeEvent, which has its own documented format.",
